    {
      "name": "Introduction",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 76,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 130,
          "text": "Marlowe was a dairy in the livestock quarter of the Lower Levels that aged hard cheese in wax for years. It closed after only a few batches, and no one on the Station has the pastures or the patience to make a wheel like these today.\n\nThis guide will provide everything you need to know to appraise the value of any Marlowe cheese wheel.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "マーロウは、下層世界の牧畜区画にあった乳製品工房で、固いチーズを蝋に包んで何年も熟成させていました。何度か仕込んだだけで閉業し、今のステーションには、同じホールを作る牧草地も根気もある者はいません。\n\n本ガイドでは、あらゆるマーロウのチーズのホールの価格を判断するために必要な情報を掲載いたします。",
            "zh": "马洛是下层区畜牧区的一家乳制品工坊，把硬质奶酪裹上蜡熟成多年。它只做了几批就关门了，如今空间站里没人有牧场或耐心去做同样的整轮奶酪。\n\n本指南将提供鉴定任何马洛整轮奶酪价值所需的全部信息。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 212,
          "w": 150,
          "h": 56,
          "text": "Regardless of condition, a Marlowe wheel has a base value of 500 Credits, and a minimum value of 100 Credits.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "状態に関わらず、マーロウのホールの基本価格は500クレジットで、最低価格は100クレジットです。",
            "zh": "无论品相如何，马洛整轮奶酪的基础价值均为500信用点，且最低价值为100信用点。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 206,
          "y": 208,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 160,
          "sprite": "hg_full",
          "fit": "stretch"
        }
      ],
      "template": "guide_page",
      "slots": {
        "header": "Station Trade Commission",
        "title": "Marlowe Aged Cheese Appraisal Guide",
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Rind",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "1. Rind",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "1. 外皮",
            "zh": "1. 外皮"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "The color of the rind tells how long a wheel has aged. The darker the rind, the older and the more valuable the wheel.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "外皮の色で、ホールがどれだけ熟成したかが分かります。外皮が黒いほど古く、価値が高くなります。",
            "zh": "外皮的颜色表明这轮奶酪熟成了多久。外皮越黑，年份越久，也越值钱。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "hg_rind_pale",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Pale Yellow Rind: Aged 3 Years\n(No Change)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "淡い黄色の外皮：熟成3年\n（変化なし）",
            "zh": "淡黄色外皮：熟成3年\n（价格不变）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 202,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "hg_rind_orange",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 202,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Orange-Brown Rind: Aged 8 Years\n(+110 Credits)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "橙褐色の外皮：熟成8年\n（+110クレジット）",
            "zh": "橙褐色外皮：熟成8年\n（+110信用点）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 280,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "hg_rind_dark",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 280,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Dark Gray Rind: Aged 15 Years\n(+260 Credits)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "暗い灰黒色の外皮：熟成15年\n（+260クレジット）",
            "zh": "深灰黑色外皮：熟成15年\n（+260信用点）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        }
      ],
      "template": "guide_page",
      "slots": {
        "header": "Station Trade Commission",
        "title": "Marlowe Aged Cheese Appraisal Guide",
        "body": ""
      }
