    {
      "name": "Seal",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "2. Seal",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "2. 封",
            "zh": "2. 封蜡"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "The seal around the side of the wheel shows which line it came from. Plain red wax is standard; the other two were made in smaller batches.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ホールの側面を包む封で、どの系列のものかが分かります。赤い蝋が標準で、ほかの2つは少ない量で作られました。",
            "zh": "包在奶酪侧面的封层表明它出自哪个系列。红蜡是标准款，另外两种产量更少。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "hg_seal_red",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Red Wax: Standard\n(No Change)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "赤い蝋：標準\n（変化なし）",
            "zh": "红蜡：标准款\n（价格不变）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 202,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "hg_seal_black",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 202,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Black Wax: Reserve\n(+60 Credits)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "黒い蝋：リザーブ\n（+60クレジット）",
            "zh": "黑蜡：珍藏款\n（+60信用点）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 280,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "hg_seal_cloth",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 280,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Cloth and Twine: Farmhouse\n(+130 Credits)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "布巻きと麻ひも：ファームハウス\n（+130クレジット）",
            "zh": "布包麻绳：农家款\n（+130信用点）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        }
      ],
      "template": "guide_page",
      "slots": {
        "header": "Station Trade Commission",
        "title": "Marlowe Aged Cheese Appraisal Guide",
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Mold",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "3. Mold",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "3. カビ",
            "zh": "3. 霉"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "A soft white bloom on the rind is a good sign. Blue-green spots mean the wheel has turned. Do not eat it.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "外皮に出る白くふわふわしたカビは、良い印です。青緑のカビの点は、傷んでいる印です。食べないでください。",
            "zh": "外皮上柔软的白霉是好兆头。青绿色的霉点表示这轮奶酪已经变质。千万不要吃。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
