    {
      "name": "Cracks",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "4. Cracks",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "4. ひび",
            "zh": "4. 裂纹"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "A hairline crack is only skin deep. A deep crack runs into the paste and lets the air in.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ヘアラインのひびは、表面だけです。深い割れは、中身まで届き、空気を入れてしまいます。",
            "zh": "发丝裂纹只在表面。深裂会伸进奶酪内部，让空气进去。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "hg_crack_none",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "No Cracks\n(No Change)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ひびなし\n（変化なし）",
            "zh": "无裂纹\n（价格不变）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
