    {
      "name": "Stamp",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "6. Stamp",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "6. 刻印",
            "zh": "6. 印记"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 92,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 36,
          "text": "Every genuine Marlowe wheel has this stamp pressed into its rind, at the back of the top face: a round ring around two wheat ears spreading in a V.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "マーロウのホールには、上面の奥の外皮に、必ずこの刻印が押されています。輪に囲まれた、V字に広がる2本の麦の穂です。",
            "zh": "每轮正品马洛奶酪的外皮上，顶面后方都压有这个印记：圆环围着两穗呈V字散开的麦穗。"
          },
